{"date":"2026-11-28T03:47:19Z","photos":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/%E7%A7%8B%E6%94%B6%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E7%A2%91.jpg/960px-%E7%A7%8B%E6%94%B6%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E7%A2%91.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%A7%8B%E6%94%B6%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E7%A2%91.jpg","a":"Ahxxm","l":"CC BY-SA 4.0","t":"​秋收起义纪念碑矗立于萍乡秋收起义广场，紧临城市主干道建设路。秋收起义广场是为纪念秋收起义而建设的纪念性广场，占地247亩，以昭萍桥为中心，萍水河为纽带，四个块面组合而成。广场以秋收起义纪念碑为重点，南向中轴线上设置五彩缤纷的音乐喷泉和气势恢宏的秋收起义纪念馆，是萍乡市区活动中心"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/HKCL_%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%A4%A8_Exhibition_Gallery_%E6%B1%9F%E8%A5%BF_JiangXi_%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%B6_Hakka_ICH_%E9%9D%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%AA%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E9%81%BA%E7%94%A2_Intangible_Cultural_Heritage_%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Exhibition_item_%E6%9C%A8%E5%88%BB%E9%9D%A2%E5%85%B7_wooden_carved_mask_June_2025_R12S_04.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HKCL_%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%A4%A8_Exhibition_Gallery_%E6%B1%9F%E8%A5%BF_JiangXi_%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%B6_Hakka_ICH_%E9%9D%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%AA%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E9%81%BA%E7%94%A2_Intangible_Cultural_Heritage_%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Exhibition_item_%E6%9C%A8%E5%88%BB%E9%9D%A2%E5%85%B7_wooden_carved_mask_June_2025_R12S_04.jpg","a":"KEWO gHOO Meandui 2000","l":"CC0","t":"HKCL 中央圖書館 Exhibition Gallery 江西 JiangXi 客家 Hakka ICH 非物質文化遺產 Intangible Cultural Heritage 展覽 Exhibition item wooden carved mask in June 202"},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/HKCL_%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%A4%A8_Exhibition_Gallery_%E6%B1%9F%E8%A5%BF_JiangXi_%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%B6_Hakka_ICH_%E9%9D%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%AA%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E9%81%BA%E7%94%A2_Intangible_Cultural_Heritage_%E5%B1%95%E8%A6%BD_Exhibition_item_